The next morning, I go to the office.
It is very hot in Kochi now.
I wear my new yellow kurti today.
This is a cotton kurti.
I reach my software office.
My colleague Prakash is there.
Prakash sees my new kurti.
He says to me, "Maya, this is a nice kurti."
"Yellow is a good colour."
I say with a small smile, "Thank you, Prakash."
"This is light cotton."
"Cotton is very good for the Kochi heat."
Prakash says, "Yes, it is very hot outside the office."
"But it is nice and cold in this office."
I sit in my seat.
These new clothes are very good.
I am very happy.
I start my work.
